'Linardos A., Kümmerer M., Press O., Bethge M. DeepGaze IIE: Calibrated Prediction in and out-of-domain for State-of-the-art Saliency Modeling. 2021. arXiv:2105.12441. DOI: 10.48550/arXiv.2105.12441.',
